      "statement": "None of the following mints, widens, transfers or reconstructs semantic, evaluation, operation or decision authority (P6, P3): - actor identity, an actor's capability, its tools or its access; - a name, label, display label, status label, role name, capability string, locator, file name or path; - declaring, naming, selecting, activating or executing a frame, or occupying a role; - implementation reachability, a reachable code path or an available operation; - the shape of evidence or of a payload, or the availability of evidence inside a frame; - a passing check, a successful step, a completed review or a count of any of them; - copying, interpreting, encoding, evaluating, transporting, projecting, compressing, importing or acquiring material; - drafting, admitting or retaining a work contract, beyond what its owner has admitted; - composition, delegation, adapters, wrappers and registries, which may restrict admitted authority or carry it faithfully, and never widen its scope, add a role, increase its cardinality or change its kind.",
